   {
    "title": "HWeekend Winter 2018 - Home Automation System (AS)",
    "description": "Home AS is an IoT Project that allows users to interact with multiple sensors in the network through a webpage (Node.js) and Google Assistant. In this 30-hours of continuous development, we've managed to integrated a webpage that reads Sensors data (Intruder Alert - uses Laser, Photoresistor, RGB LED | Soil -  Moisture Sensor | Lights - RGB LED Strip | Heart Rate Monitor - ECG).\n\nSensors are connected to Wemos D1 WiFi that pushes data into it's web page based on an IP in a JSON format.\nIntruder Alert - Uses lasers and photoresistor to check if an intruder is in the house. RGB LED lights up as an indicator of \"INTRUDER ALERT\"\nSoil - Sparkfun's Moisture Sensor to indicate if it's time to water the garden\nLights - Beautiful WS2812B RGB LED Strip\nHeart Rate Monitor - Uses AD8232 chip to measure electrical activity of the heart",
    "dateRange": {},
    "associatedWith": "Jan 2018 - Jan 2018"
